{"id":"da127c5079c0fe44","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-initial-terminal.md","title":"Initial and Terminal Objects","display":"df-initial-terminal — Initial and Terminal Objects","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-initial-terminal","aliases":["58-df-initial-terminal"],"display":"df-initial-terminal — Initial and Terminal Objects","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-initial-terminal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-initial-terminal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-initial-terminal — Initial and Terminal Objects"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,I,T\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,I,T\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Initial}_S,\\mathrm{Terminal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Initial}_S,\\mathrm{Terminal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}initial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Initial}_S(I,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land I\\in O\n\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in M\\;(s(f)=I\\land t(f)=A)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}initial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Initial}_S(I,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land I\\in O\n\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in M\\;(s(f)=I\\land t(f)=A)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}terminal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Terminal}_S(T,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land T\\in O\n\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in M\\;(s(f)=A\\land t(f)=T)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}terminal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Terminal}_S(T,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land T\\in O\n\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in M\\;(s(f)=A\\land t(f)=T)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The category is an explicit argument; its object set and source/target maps are unpacked from the same six-component datum used by the upstream category predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,I,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Initial}_S,\\mathrm{Terminal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}initial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Initial}_S(I,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land I\\in O\n\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in M\\;(s(f)=I\\land t(f)=A)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}terminal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Terminal}_S(T,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land T\\in O\n\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\exists!f\\in M\\;(s(f)=A\\land t(f)=T)\n\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1237,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-683","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-initial-terminal.md|58-df-initial-terminal]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}